@startuml "Communication avec participants - Organisateur"

title Envoi de notifications aux participants

actor "Organisateur" as Organizer
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "API Gateway\n(Rate Limiter)" as API
participant "Auth Middleware" as Auth
participant "Notification Service" as NotifSvc
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

== Communication avec participants ==
Organizer -> Frontend: Envoyer notification
Frontend -> API: POST /api/events/{eventId}/notifications
note right: Body: {message, type: 'email'|'push', targetAudience}
API -> Auth: Vérifier propriété événement
Auth --> API: access granted

API -> NotifSvc: sendEventNotification(eventId, message, options)
NotifSvc -> DB: SELECT users FROM orders WHERE eventId=? AND status='paid'
DB --> NotifSvc: participants list

loop Pour chaque participant
    alt Email notification
        NotifSvc -> NotifSvc: sendEmail(user, message)
    else Push notification
        NotifSvc -> NotifSvc: sendPushNotification(user, message)
    end
end

NotifSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO notifications (eventId, message, sentAt, recipientCount)
DB --> NotifSvc: notification logged

NotifSvc --> API: notification sent
API --> Frontend: {sentCount, failedCount}
Frontend --> Organizer: "Notification envoyée à X participants"

@enduml